From fe8794a43090806a4e8d9e90ad0c3f710641c7f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:58:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update the upstream signing key

Update tdb.keyring to the current copy at
https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/samba-pubkey.asc#/tdb.keyring, the
URL the spec names for it (same certificate(s)).

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 libtdb.spec |   2 +-
 tdb.keyring | Bin 1509 -> 10638 bytes
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libtdb.spec b/libtdb.spec
index 6db8588..fc419d5 100644
--- a/libtdb.spec
+++ b/libtdb.spec
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@ URL:             http://tdb.samba.org/
 Source0:         http://samba.org/ftp/tdb/tdb-%{version}.tar.gz
 Source1:         http://samba.org/ftp/tdb/tdb-%{version}.tar.asc
 # gpg2 --no-default-keyring --keyring ./tdb.keyring --recv-keys 9147A339719518EE9011BCB54793916113084025
-Source2:         tdb.keyring
+Source2:         https://download.samba.org/pub/samba/samba-pubkey.asc#/tdb.keyring
 
 BuildRequires: make
 BuildRequires: gcc
diff --git a/tdb.keyring b/tdb.keyring
